  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An object of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> is accelerated from rest by a constant resultant force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The final velocity of the object is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What energy is transferred to the object during the acceleration? <br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Fv}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Fv\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mv^{2}}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mv^{2}\"></span></li></ol>"
